    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "“太漂亮了！”小五想。现在，小五在山的那边。",
      "traditional": "“太漂亮了！”小五想。現在，小五在山的那邊。",
      "pinyin": "tài piào liang le xiǎo wǔ xiǎng xiàn zài xiǎo wǔ zài shān de nèi bian",
      "english": "“It’s very beautiful!” Little Wu thought. Little Wu was now on that side of the mountain."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "这儿都是桃树。树上都开着桃花，地上也都是桃花。",
      "traditional": "這兒都是桃樹。樹上都開著桃花，地上也都是桃花。",
      "pinyin": "zhè‘r dōu shì táo shù shù shang dōu kāi zhe táo huā dì shang yě dōu shì táo huā",
      "english": "Here, there were peach trees everywhere. There were peach blossoms on the trees and peach blossoms on the ground."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "虽然小五是记者，他坐了很多飞机，去了很多地方，",
      "traditional": "雖然小五是記者，他坐了很多飛機，去了很多地方，",
      "pinyin": "suī rán xiǎo wǔ shì jì zhě tā zuò le hěn duō fēi jī qù le hěn duō dì fang",
      "english": "Although Little Wu was a journalist and had taken many airplanes and been to many places, .."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "但是他没看见过那么漂亮的地方。",
      "traditional": "但是他沒看見過那麼漂亮的地方。",
      "pinyin": "dàn shì tā méi kàn jiàn guò nà me piào liang de dì fang",
      "english": ".. he had never seen such a beautiful place."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "小五听到有人在笑，他往前走。",
      "traditional": "小五聽到有人在笑，他往前走。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo wǔ tīng dào yǒu rén zài xiào tā wǎng qián zǒu",
      "english": "Little Wu heard people laughing. He walked forward."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "天气很好，不冷也不热，也没有下雨。",
      "traditional": "天氣很好，不冷也不熱，也沒有下雨。",
      "pinyin": "tiān qì hěn hǎo bù lěng yě bú rè yě méi yǒu xià yǔ",
      "english": "The weather was good, neither cold nor hot, and it wasn’t not raining."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "他看见很多房子。这些房子虽然有点奇怪，但是很漂亮。",
      "traditional": "他看見很多房子。這些房子雖然有點奇怪，但是很漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "tā kàn jiàn hěn duō fáng zi zhè xiē fáng zi suī rán yǒu diǎn qí guài dàn shì hěn piào liang",
      "english": "He saw many houses. Although these houses were a little strange, they were beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "房子前面有老人和孩子，他们在说话，他们都在笑。",
      "traditional": "房子前面有老人和孩子，他們在說話，他們都在笑。",
