      "english": "There was an old man and a child in front of the houses. They were talking, and they were both laughing."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "虽然他们的衣服有点奇怪，但是他们很快乐。",
      "traditional": "雖然他們的衣服有點奇怪，但是他們很快樂。",
